  "atomic_questions": [
    "is the lab actually staffed for only part of the day (i.e., there is a specific set of open hours each day, which I should treat as the coverage requirement), or is the lab open the full 8:00–22:00 every day and the student on duty may simply be off-duty for part of that span?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response presents a single clarification request framed as a binary choice between two mutually exclusive interpretations of the staffing requirement."
}

