  ],
  "rationale": "The response presents a single decision point: whether to apply a uniform minimum hours value (and which one) or to use placeholders. Although it contains a sub-choice ('8 or 7'), it is contingent on the first part of the question and represents a single policy choice for handling the pending classification."
}

